73252624, "y": 0.379243788682345, "w": 0.8260989419117193, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "with relatives, as once children leave school, they won't have the free time to", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.40757413875648263, "w": 0.826077001571605, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "develop these strong bonds. The arguments for shorter holidays mention families", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4359044888306202, "w": 0.8266120793055124, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "where parents work and cannot take so much leave, and that it helps children not", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4642348766261504, "w": 0.826011898225939, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "to fall behind in their studies. The candidate concludes that stronger family bonds", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.49258997193377513, "w": 0.8262949696233941, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "are more important, so longer holidays are best. There is some minor repetition in", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5209203220079127, "w": 0.8266809760744692, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the ideas presented.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5492507098034429, "w": 0.21194530027149633, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Ideas are logically organised, and cohesive devices are varied. Reference is used", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.577581097598973, "w": 0.8260989419117193, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "[This I they I their] but some inaccuracy in linking devices [Where as I On the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6059114476731107, "w": 0.8258594436196312, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "otherside I Coming to], and some repetition [relatives I valuable] limits the rating", 